<title>USA: RailAmerica Inc Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>RailAmerica Inc Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>RailAmerica Inc.</p>
<p>			    First Quarter 1997 Financial Highlights</p>
<p>				  For the Three Months Ended March 31</p>
<p>					     1997		  1996</p>
<p> Revenues			   $8,057,312	  $6,144,112</p>
<p>Income from Continuing</p>
<p>  Operations			   349,531	     324,777</p>
<p>Per Share Income from</p>
<p>  Continuing Operations		 0.04		  0.07</p>
<p>Loss from Discontinued</p>
<p>  Operations (a)		    (61,680)	   (112,970)</p>
<p> Net Income			    287,851	     211,807</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share		   0.04		  0.05</p>
<p>Wtd. Avg. Common Shares and</p>
<p>  Common Share Equivalents     8,198,160	   4,680,141</p>
<p>NOTE:(a) In March 1997, the company adopted a plan to discontinue its motor carrier segment.  The motor carrier segment's loss reduced net income $61,680 (less than $.01 per share impact) in the first quarter of 1997 and $112,970, or $.02 per share, in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
</text>
